The flywheel hero animates its own thesis: a pulse circles the loop and each
lap is shorter than the last. Under "a change lands once", the slot that named
the landing tool cycled four generic entries, one of them a literal
placeholder. It now rolls a three-line log of twelve tools this repo actually
improves, primed to mark the new version: nix', clippy', fmt', mgrep',
astlog', cargo', kernel', tui', sdk', vt', ci', site'. The newest land sits on
top and pushes older ones down, still keyed to the same accelerating loop
boundaries, and reduced-motion readers get the static top three.
